.625], "widgets_values": ["[S1] 我让AIGC帮我整理了份“Super Efficient Study Plan”（超高效学习计划），它说照着学一周，就能轻松养成专注习惯\n[S2] 可你昨天对着计划坐了一下午，不是刷工作群消息就是摸鱼吃零食，一页书都没翻啊\n[S1] 我去问AI了，它说问题不在计划——“Plan 管得住学习节奏，管不住你把‘学习时段’改成‘工作摸鱼缓冲期’”\n[S2] 合着这计划是给真要学习的人准备的，治不了你“一沾工作就不想碰书本”的毛病啊"], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "text"}, "name": "text", "label": "text", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "文本"}], "flags": {}, "id": 6, "type": "Text Multiline", "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "Text Multiline"}, "order": 3}], "extra": {"links_added_by_ue": [], "ue_links": [], "0246.VERSION": [0, 0, 4], "ds": {"offset": [1056.8599396184513, 126.39504563380989], "scale": 0.7972024500000005}}, "groups": [{"color": "#3f789e", "font_size": 120, "flags": {}, "id": 1, "title": "欢迎关注【破狼】公众号", "bounding": [167.125, -120.51953125, 1376.526611328125, 188.62872314453125]}], "links": [[1, 3, 0, 1, 0, "AUDIO"], [2, 4, 0, 1, 1, "AUDIO"], [3, 1, 0, 5, 0, "AUDIO"], [4, 6, 0, 1, 2, "STRING"]], "id": "818a1400-3ac4-4daf-9749-4645816beba4", "config": {}, "version": 0.4, "last_node_id": 6, "revision": 0}